WEBVTT

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.500
Right now, healthcare work
is going out to tender.

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:15.100
Most of it is found too late.

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:23.600
The hard part was never the work.
It was the finding.

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:36.200
Qura pulls live procurement
from Find a Tender,

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.160
Contracts Finder, TED and SAM.gov.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.500
Every morning.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.900
Each notice linked back
to the original.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:50.900
348 named decision-makers
across 171 organisations.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:55.100
Find one person, then walk
the trust around them.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.300
One profile, every compliance
document in one place.

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:05.400
Registered means they told us.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.800
Verified means a person checked.

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:15.600
Introductions only open
after that check.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:18.300
So when a conversation starts,
it is a real one.

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:24.600
Qura.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.900
Live healthcare demand,
and the people behind it.
